  "note": "capturedState records what the 2026-08-14 tenant capture found. It is documentation, not control flow: both provisioning scripts re-read the live list and create only what is genuinely absent, so a field added since the capture is skipped rather than duplicated. Title is every list's native column and is never listed here. A field marked PENDING that carries provisionedBy has since been created in the tenant; the named record's ledger is the evidence, and capturedState still says what the 2026-08-14 capture found rather than what is true today.",
